OL,3,GNEWSAActor's rise from Wolverhampton to
OL,4,Athe big screen
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn actor from Wolverhampton has said
OL,7,Fthere has never been a better time for
OL,8,FSouth Asian creatives in the film
OL,9,Findustry, following the release of his
OL,10,Fnew movie.
OL,12,FSunjay Midda, 30, from All Saints,
OL,13,Fstars alongside Mena Massoud in Daniel
OL,14,Fand the Fiery Furnace, which premiered
OL,15,Fin the US and Canada and is now
OL,16,Fstreaming on Apple TV.
OL,18,FSpeaking to BBC Radio WM, he said his
OL,19,Faspirations to be on the silver screen
OL,20,Fbegan at school when he dropped out of
OL,21,Fsixth form to pursue his career.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
