OL,3,GNEWSAActor's rise from Wolverhampton to
OL,4,Athe big screen
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said that the film industry has come
OL,7,Fa long way in showcasing representation
OL,8,Fbut he thinks there is still a way to
OL,9,Fgo, adding: "Our stages need to reflect
OL,10,Fsociety.
